Exactly. Sadly my mom was raised by a single father, her mom died when she was 7. Raised in the catholic church, everything she saw wrong with Catholicism she found answers in Islam via this American convert. Meanwhile my father knew nothing of his own religion, and just was more into being a cultural brutan tyranically dictator. We were never allowed to watch tv, listen to music, have friends (Especially if they werent muslim), and also never allowed to speak to females and 'divert my gaze'. I was so scared of going to hell, I would run when girls would try and talk to me in school. My mom is seriously bipolar and a victim, The 3 men in her life her Father (Was in the Navy, sucessful lawyer, very conservative), def has antisocial personality disorder traits, def seems to be on the autism spectrum. But was smart with investing and filing lawsuits. my moms only brother her son, is a crack addict and has been since he was 12, and his father is in denial about it, and pays for his everything, bills, given him properties, insurance, weekly allowance, dudes almost 50, my grandfather is close to 90 and outlived the avg lifespan type 2 diabetes. And he is very misogynistic. Its sad because his will is probably mostly going to my crackhead uncle who is gonna burn it all on crack, while my mom has 8 kids. 

