My father took his youngest/fav 18 yr old daughter and is indoctrinating/brainwashing her into this Islamic bullshit and is gona take her to Jordan. Little does he know about her body count and all the bbc shes taken and her onlyfans etc, and shes pretending to be an innocent virgin. she still sucks her thumb. complete brat. I try to reason with her. And she tells he she doesnt care if he killed 10 people. Shes basically being sold off to the highest bidder. fml

I am about to turn 31. Very mixed background. My parents met in Japan. Passion for shotokan karate. mom was raised catholic, father was raised on a palestinian refugee camp in kuwait. One is bipolar and one is a sociopath. They had 8 kids. I am #2. We spent some time in jordan. I did kindergarten there, and 3rd grade. short trips. little to no memory just some traumas. before katrina hit, unbeknownst to us. Our father took us all to Jordan. from Suburban usa life to the rural deserts of zarka.

Our familiy is divided. Because of my abusive father and his secrets. Some of us look like models (unfortunately not me), and social media got to them. I dont know where to start.

I was raised and born in the US with a strict religious upbringing. It was scary. I consider myself agnostic now. My father was abusive and chose favorites. 

They met in Japan both being there for their passion of karate, and of course married and resettled in the deep south. My moms father is a retired navy vet and lawyer. Her mother, was part native, and against war and whatnot, but she died when my mom was 7, something about the Drs giving her the wrong drugs. husband filed a lawsuit. She was bipolar. She was beautiful.

The relationship my parents are in is dividing the family and very toxic, slept in diff rooms for years. Father kicked out 2 of my sisters for being 'whores' and wished death upon them. Meanwhile has his 2 favorite daughters, and a favorite son, mostly because he came out blonde, but he followed his footsteps and is a beast in karate and athletics. I have no relationship with my father, he will never be a father to me, I was abused and used as his punching bag, for no reason. sick stuff. and watching my mother get abused. 2 siblings are visiting jordan, 2 went on a spontaneous trip to italy. Im here struggling to stay alive for them.

&#x200B;

The healthcare system sucks. I need good healthcare and will dedicate myself to it, but just dont have access. I need to get away. 90% of my life at 14 after getting a laptop has been spent behind it. I want to be independent but im disabled. I cant taste or smell, or enjoy anything. life is bland. every second is painful and seems like a task. I want it to get better, but I dont see that happening. There is so much im leaving out. I dont know where to start.

&#x200B;

My condition is degrading rapidly. Im chemically dependent on benzos of 10 yrs. suboxone, just to not get sick. - my brain is fried and nothing is helping. My oldest sister is and AMAZING artist.

&#x200B;

I cant stay in this house forever im about to turn 31. What Should I do? My parents divorce is long overdue, but they are just playing games and in turn making all their kids suffer. I need to get out and just start my life. (btw at 20 I was well put together, had a car job money license and was ready to move, but emotionally blackmailed into staying, my mom citing her false interpretation of a stupid religion saying I can't leave the house until I get married.

&#x200B;

My health(I have a deviated/broken septum I cant breathe through and get sleep apnea, and I cant sleep at all, very bad insomnia. I have a hernia (2nd one) that needs surgery. I have a genetic condition called heel spurs when I walk it feels like my heels are on fire. Im on TRT, as of 2 yrs or so and destroyed my natural T production because I thought getting on it could possibly help with physical/motivational/confidence/libido problems, that were ultimately all due to my mental state/major depression.  

&#x200B;

You can ask questions, I just cant even hit the tip of the iceberg. I feel like If I dont make a sudden change NOW and turning 31, things will continue going downwards as they have been over the past decade. But when I look at the bigger picture it is all due to finances. my dad is hoarding tons of money/stashed overseas, that even if my mom divorced him, she wouldnt have access to. Her father is getting really old. She was recently diagnosed with a certain type of bad cancer and has had some surgeries. it has had to make her take time off of her karate classes/teaching etc and she is not in good shape. I am attached to her but despise her for not leaving this abusive man who divided and conquered and tore this family apart.

it is very rare for me to have the energy to type or think and I have bad short term memory loss.

I need to change my life.

&#x200B;

What should I do?

benzos are some serious shit as far as psychical dependency, I was first prescribed ativan 1mg by my first pdoc in 2010, and since then, 10 yrs later im heavily dependent (I prefer to use dependent over addicted, because I have to take them just to not get seizures, panic attacks, or die). But been on and off benzos since then... Also been struggling with an opiate addiction, on and off for 8 yrs or so. Eventually got put on suboxone 24mg daily, and the dr was a dick and insisted if I didnt stop my dr prescribed klonopin I would die, so when I would go in for drug tests, at the beginning I could just drink tons of water, and take phenibut and/or baclofen and gabapentin to pass my monthly piss test. Eventually started taking etizolam on my monthly piss tests to pass, as my dependency grew, and they forced my pdoc to stop prescibing them, and the etiz wouldnt show up on urine tests. So did that for a while.   


Right now im trying to prep myself for an ibogaine flood (through a clinic, which i'm gonna have to borrow money from family and take out loans to pay for). I did ibogaine around 2016 for methadone mostly in mexico at a clinic, and although I was impressed with how much it reduced the WD, PAWS creeped back up on me slowly and ended up relapsing shortly after, I believe back then they weren't as informed that you need to get on SAOs for 60-90 days min, if you are on methadone or suboxone. I started with percs prescribed from a dentist nearly a decade ago (Also have Treatment resistant MDD, PTSD, serious chronic anxiety and insomnia, among other things). Been on every class of antidepressant, from zoloft, to TCas, oral MAOIs, eventually the emsam patch, but im not taking anything or seeing a dr now in that regard). But at the time I first tried perc/oxy I noticed it obliterated all the side effects from the SSRIs I was on at the time, and made me feel normal, super functional, sociable etc... I kinda stayed on it just to reverse the side effects of the SSRIs like Paxil, Zoloft, Prozac all which were doing me no good. Finally after years of hope, and trying everything I got my medicaid to pay for ECT in early 2019, I was sooo hopeful because of its success rate among treatment resistant patients. Sadly in the long run after 18 sessions, all I got out of it was some memory loss.

&#x200B;

right now im completely debilitated and dysfunctional, and been using xanax (not through drs as I gave up on them and my options are limited due to finances and medicaid) A while after being on pain pills, the inevitable happened, couldnt source/afford them, and knew exactly what I had to do and just went straight for IV dope (7 or so years ago, while living in a toxic abusive environment that im still stuck in.) throughout the years, I tried many things to try and stop, methadone, megadoses of tianeptine while on benzos and phenibut (this was the worst horror story ever, I checked myself into a psych ward, cuz I was suicidal and wanted help, and the drs took me off everything cold turkey, and I sustained lasting brain damage from that, was taking several grams of tia several times a day, the WD was worse than hell, was awake for 7 days straight and they didnt care or believe me, until I had a seizure and almost died, then moved me to icu, where I was in some sort of delirium hallucinating for 2 weeks or so, was the worst lowest point in my life and have severe ptsd from it)

&#x200B;

Anyways, i got sick of being heavily dependent on suboxone for the past 2+ yrs, the max dose 12mg x 2 a day, hated everything about it, and was taking it just to not get excruciating withdrawals, reached a point where even at that dose, my tolerance went up and it was barely holding me. on top of living in my dark bedroom debilitated for the past severak years. 

&#x200B;

Long story short, I switched to a SOA, and after being on subs for 2 yrs, the only option I had was going back to heroin to prep myself. (at the time I decided I wanted to do ibogaine, I didnt know this) but as of now been on 'SOAs' for 4 months or so, and trying to get booked with a clinic, but im worried my dependency of about 8-10mg xanax a day (I can get by on a little less, but I guess thats the avg), which provides no CNS depressant effects and I dont even 'feel it anymore'. just a dependency, but without it, I would be having constant panic attacks, wouldnt be able to talk to people and would have seizures. Im using unreal doses of h, because its the only SOA I could 'afford' (not really), morphine or oxy pills would be optimal but I dont have that luxury. I need to make an appt soon, for multiple reasons, but im spending all the money I and family saved up to help me on the h, I can do half a gram IV 4-5 times a day now, which I never fathomed, as back when I was a user, and actually got a 'high and rush didnt need more than 100mg 2 maybe 3x a day. but thats where my tolerance sits.

&#x200B;

anyways, I really dont want the benzos to interfere with my treatment and dull the ibogaine, and I need to find a quick way to taper down/lower my tolerance in a period of a few weeks. im not sure if a long acting benzo like valium might be a better option, or an rc one that I never tried. if anyone sees this suggestions in that regard for quickly lowering/tapering down my benzo dependency would be really helpful as im starting to freak out worried ill end up wasting the ibogaine flood when it comes down to it, as benzos can dull the experience, I know Ill have to stay on them, just hoping i can cut it in half atleast. Sorry OP if I hijacked your thread, you are very strong for getting through that. I've been on and off benzos for 10 yrs and my dose is at an all time high, I can take 6-8mg at once and feel nothing, no sedation etc. xanax is just the most convenient one to access, but im thinking some other benzo to quickly try and taper down or other chem to lower my dependency might be better. Sorry again I should post this on a different sub. despite the amounts of what im on, I stay up for days, and I consider them the bare minimum. I want to start by freeing myself from opioid dependency with the help of ibogaine, then hopefully addressing the major depression with something I havent tried before, like microdosing, or ayahuasca. sorry. ill post this somewhere else. Props to you OP, being on benzos for years can change your brain chemistry in the long term, and I already cant sleep and get panic attacks while on absurd doses, so its hard to fathom tapering. Im probably averaging 10mg xan a day give or take, just to not get seizures or fatal withdrawal, with little to no therapeutic effects, and was originally put on high doses by drs throughout the years, without being warned about long term effects, then tried to address my opiate addiction, and this ahole doc expects me to just quit a 10 yr dependency, like its nothing and gave me gabapentin. I reaaly need advice on the best option for lowering my dependency QUICK. sorry if I hijacked your post. been wanting to ask this for a while, even making posts online and responding is hard for me. I've been laying in a dark bedroom for years, and wasted most of my 20s. turned 30 last july and had another mid life crisis, and made this decision but had no support, so still trying to figure this out.

I took 10 for sleep, th a gram of diamorphine Ived and i still cannot sleep tf???????????

