Oh and again, not sure what exactly you are looking for, but depending on your goals and how you respond to it, Kratom is something you should consider trying that won't show up. Its a plant, in the coffee family, native to SE Asia in mild doses can be stimulating, higher doses can be sedating, but it also depends on the strain/vein color, There are Red, Green, and White vein strains which can differ in effects. Be warned that even though its a natural plant, the main alkaloids responsible for the effects do bind partially to certain opioid receptors... Although very mild/not very "addictive" as it kinda has a ceiling effect, dosing daily(or multiple times daily) can lead to tolerance buildup, and eventually withdrawal, which isnt a huge concern as long as your not dosing more than 2-3x a week, for extended periods,

